                                                "sense_id": "319ccdf9-4bc3-3a8e-9355-85942a309f06",
                                                "text": "Otamendi’s selection ahead of Vincent Kompany was difficult to fathom and, apart from Fernandinho, City’s line-up was otherwise filled with attacking players."
